This repository contains two kinds of material, released under two licenses.

1. Source code — MIT License
   All scripts under github/analysis/, run_all.sh, and any other program code.
   Full text: see LICENSE_CODE.txt

2. Data, model weights, and figures — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
   Processed matrices, frozen prediction matrices, held-out scores, bootstrap
   summaries, supplementary tables S1–S33, figure source data, and figure files.
   Full text: see LICENSE_DATA.txt

Third-party raw data (LINCS L1000, DepMap, GTEx) are not covered by the licenses
above and remain under their original terms. Provenance and source licenses are
listed in DATA_SOURCES.md.

